# Script caches
# NB: use ``dir/*`` (not ``dir/``) so git still descends into the directory and
# the negation below can re-include the one committed file — a bare ``dir/``
# excludes the whole tree and makes ``!dir/file`` a no-op.
scripts/tier0_output_cache/*
# Exception: the committed Tier-0 fixture that lets the Tier 1-5 harness CI run
# the 13 agents on every PR (issue #600). Everything else in this dir
# (timestamped tier0_state_*.pkl, local-regen symlinks) stays ignored.
!scripts/tier0_output_cache/latest.pkl
.cache/

